  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2022; To further develop Pillar 3 of MWC program, one model is to create partnerships with impact investors to jointly support its investees (local MFI&#x2019;s) to build a WASH loan portfolio.&#x2022; Aqua for all and Oikocredit are in a two-year partnership to increase access to finance for WASH enterprises and households in Africa and Asia.&#x2022; As a result of exploring immediate opportunities, A4A is working with MFIs to develop and grow their WASH portfolios, starting with a successful collaboration with Chamroeun and LOLC in Cambodia, Hofokam and EBO Sacco in Uganda, and Sidian Bank in Kenya.</narrative>
  </description>
